WEBVTT

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:02.140
Fusion Summon!

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:04.380
Appear, Level 10...

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:09.800
Power that turns the world to formless chaos.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:13.210
...Chaos Ancient Gear Giant!

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:16.090
I-It's huge!

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:17.290
Insurmountable.

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:34.340
No!

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:39.780
Sayaka!

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:45.460
Syun...

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.700
Syun! Sayaka!

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:55.400
I'm glad you're safe.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.150
Syun...

00:00:59.010 --> 00:01:00.670
You're helping us, Kaito?

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:03.740
Worry about your ally, not me!

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:07.520
Are you ready to make your confession?!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.050
Go... Battle!

00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:15.390
Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon, attack all 
three members of the Obelisk Force!

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:18.590
Annihilating Cipher Stream!

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:30.370
Looks like we're up again.

00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:32.890
Kurosaki! Answer me!

00:01:32.890 --> 00:01:35.040
Let no one else interfere!

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:38.280
Yusyo Sakaki's son...

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:41.410
I shall bury you myself.

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:46.320
The Aquaria Project.

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:52.090
In their plan to create an ideal world, 
the Fusion Dimension's Academia

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:57.430
has driven Heartland City, in the Xyz 
Dimension, to the brink of obliteration.

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:35.990
Broken Smile World

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:38.580
A word, if I may, Commander.

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:43.310
The Professor directly ordered 
us to take out the Lancers—

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:44.440
Silence!

00:03:45.810 --> 00:03:47.360
Hold on a minute...

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:50.880
Unless he's fighting us, 
Yuya's entertainment won't be exciting!

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:53.020
Yuya?

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:56.780
I see.

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:59.720
Yuya Sakaki, eh?

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:03.820
Hey! Are you listening, Commander Edo?

00:04:03.820 --> 00:04:04.760
You two!

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:08.040
Shut your mouths for a minute!

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:12.840
Commander, for you to personally 
appear before the Lancers...

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:14.650
Does this not seem a bit unnecessary—

00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:20.270
That is to say, you need not 
go into battle yourself.

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:22.670
Just leave this to us!

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:28.060
I promise, I will make the Lancers—

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:29.910
I shall speak with you later.

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:33.710
I have no need of your interference!

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:35.390
Just stand quietly and watch.

00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:42.120
He knows I'm the one

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:46.180
who petitioned the Professor to 
send anti-Lancers duelists.

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:49.030
Kurosaki! Kurosaki!

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:51.740
Hey, this is looking pretty bad.

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:54.970
For now, let's just take him back to base!

00:04:54.970 --> 00:04:56.440
Hurry, get him on my back!

00:04:58.430 --> 00:05:00.080
Field Spell Crossover.

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:11.140
What are you doing?

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:22.950
This is...

00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:27.110
I activated Field Spell Steel Cage Match.

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:31.840
Now, no one can interfere in our duel.

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:38.000
I am Edo Phoenix, supreme commander 
of Academia's Xyz Expeditionary Force.

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:41.050
Yuya Sakaki, we'll settle things at last.

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:44.220
Wait! I have no intention 
of accepting this duel!

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:45.510
It's no use, Yuya.

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:46.710
Ute?

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:49.280
Academia's members are so cruel,

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:54.120
they'll mercilessly challenge even 
the critically wounded to duels.

00:05:54.840 --> 00:05:59.770
If we want Syun and the others to reach 
safety, our only choice is to beat Edo.

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:06.710
Well? Is that understood?

00:06:07.350 --> 00:06:08.170
Yes, sir.

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:10.150
We'll spring into action at once.

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:14.620
Hey, I think Yuya might be in trouble.

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:26.730
I won't let Edo hog all the credit.

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:27.980
Everyone!

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:31.170
Seems we're the ones in trouble now...

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:35.620
Kaito!

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:38.280
Leave this to me.

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:39.350
Yuya!

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:41.710
I'll handle the small fry!

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:43.770
Kaito...

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:47.450
I accept your duel!

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:50.090
Come, Edo Phoenix!

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:51.070
Duel!

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:54.320
I shall go first.

00:06:54.320 --> 00:06:58.460
I summon Destiny HERO — 
Decider from my hand!

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:06.780
With this duel, I'll prove it...

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:11.380
That Academia's duels and

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:15.210
the Professor's teachings are correct.

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:22.520
To do so, I must beat Yusyo Sakaki's son!

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:24.490
I end my turn.

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:27.760
I'll finish this duel with a flurry of attacks.

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:29.020
My turn!

00:07:29.430 --> 00:07:32.860
I set the Pendulum Scale with

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:37.500
Scale 3 Performapal Handstandaccoon 
and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician! {D: TC - this is the only one that I wasn't sure of, but it's the only one left on the new list for this week}

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:43.710
Now I can summon monsters between 
Levels 4 and 7 simultaneously!

00:07:44.260 --> 00:07:46.680
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:49.650
Draw a shining arc in the sky!

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:51.450
Pendulum Summon!

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:54.420
Appear, my monsters!

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:58.820
First, Performapal Dag Daggerman!

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:03.160
And the heroic one with beautiful, 
different-colored eyes,

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:05.620
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:10.270
Oh? Straight to Pendulum Summon!

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:11.580
Battle!

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:17.180
I attack Destiny HERO — Decider with 
Performapal Dag Daggerman!

00:08:21.880 --> 00:08:26.780
And Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon 
attacks you directly!

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:29.790
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:08:31.020 --> 00:08:32.480
To activate the effect

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:37.130
of Destiny Hero — Dynatag, I send it 
from my hand to my graveyard!

00:08:37.130 --> 00:08:39.960
When I have fewer life points 
than my opponent,

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:45.570
I negate battle damage and deal 
1000 damage to both players.

00:08:45.970 --> 00:08:48.520
At the same time, I activate Decider's effect.

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:51.620
On the turn that this card 
is sent to the graveyard

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:53.770
and effect damage is dealt to me,

00:08:53.770 --> 00:08:58.280
I can return it to my hand and 
negate the effect damage to me.

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:08.120
Wow, Edo's pretty good.

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:10.680
Well, it wouldn't be interesting if he weren't.

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:12.550
Enough, Grace!

00:09:13.120 --> 00:09:18.240
Let's leave the commander and take 
part in destroying the Lancers!

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:20.760
Wait a minute...

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:22.750
It's about to get good!

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:31.870
Kaito!

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:32.680
Yuya!

00:09:33.290 --> 00:09:35.790
Right now, focus on your own duel.

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:37.360
Yeah, I will.

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:40.060
I end my turn!

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:42.530
My turn. Draw!

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:46.890
I activate my spell card 
Polymerization in my hand,

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:51.270
and fuse Destiny HEROs Decider 
and Drilldark by sending them

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:53.400
from my hand to the graveyard!

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:56.480
The hero who decides the fate of victory...

00:09:56.480 --> 00:09:59.080
The hero who pierces the 
bedrock of destiny...

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:02.410
Become one, and reign over a future of darkness!

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:04.120
Fusion Summon!

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:08.520
Come on, Destiny HERO — Dystopia!

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:15.460
Dystopia's effect!

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:19.960
Dystopia deals Decider's attack points as 
damage when it is a fusion component.

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:21.860
Squeeze Palm!

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:28.340
It isn't over yet!

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:30.110
Come on already, Grace.

00:10:30.110 --> 00:10:31.980
Wait! Just a bit longer!

00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:36.180
I equip my spell Delay Armor to Dystopia,

00:10:36.180 --> 00:10:39.250
and attack Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:10:39.710 --> 00:10:41.840
Dystopia Blow!

00:10:47.890 --> 00:10:50.860
And Equip Spell Delay Armor's effect activates!

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:56.500
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon's destruction also 
destroys the lower-leveled Dag Daggerman.

00:10:58.520 --> 00:11:01.890
And it deals 500 points of damage to you!

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:09.380
Yuya Sakaki...

00:11:09.380 --> 00:11:11.850
I shall defeat you, no matter what!

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:17.400
And I shall prove that Yusyo Sakaki's 
style of dueling is mistaken!

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:19.290
I'll finish it.

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:22.880
I attack with five Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragons!

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:25.260
Annihilating Cipher Stream!

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:32.420
Yuya!

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:35.040
We're okay over here!

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:37.610
Kaito beat them all!

00:11:38.020 --> 00:11:40.350
Let us handle Kurosaki!

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:42.810
You focus on your duel!

00:11:44.130 --> 00:11:45.020
Yuya!

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:54.890
My Academia elite squadron,

00:11:54.890 --> 00:11:57.400
all beaten by a single duelist.

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:59.070
That's impossible!

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:03.440
Despite deploying the army, 
you still let the Lancers escape?

00:12:03.440 --> 00:12:04.600
What a failure.

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:07.320
I'm not the one who failed!

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:11.380
It was Commander Edo who 
brought Academia's army here.

00:12:14.950 --> 00:12:16.250
Not good.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:20.590
If Edo wins this duel, I'll be disgraced...

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:25.580
Now, there are no more distractions. 
Show us the greatest duel.

00:12:25.580 --> 00:12:27.610
All right, Yuya?

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:33.300
I set one card and end my turn.

00:12:35.740 --> 00:12:37.240
My turn!

00:12:40.680 --> 00:12:45.880
I use the Pendulum Scale, with Scale 3 
and Scale 8 already set,

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:47.660
to Pendulum Summon!

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:49.880
Be reborn from my Extra Deck!

00:12:52.390 --> 00:12:54.620
Performapal Dag Daggerman

00:12:55.350 --> 00:12:57.830
and Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:04.880
He Pendulum Summoned again?

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:08.200
Dystopia's attack points are 2800.

00:13:08.790 --> 00:13:10.640
Now he has a chance to fight back.

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:12.670
Well, what will you do, Yuya?

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:17.850
Have you realized how powerless your tepid

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:21.150
"bringing smiles with duels" philosophy is,

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:23.350
before Academia's might?

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:28.320
How can I use our duel to 
communicate with Edo?

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:30.180
You're talking about that again?

00:13:30.720 --> 00:13:34.680
He's convinced that their 
way of dueling is right.

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:37.830
He's dueling in order to prove it.

00:13:38.550 --> 00:13:41.300
Their way of dueling...

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:44.030
Of course!

00:13:44.030 --> 00:13:46.840
Then, I'll speak to him with his own words!

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:50.380
I activate Handstandaccoon's 
Pendulum Effect!

00:13:50.380 --> 00:13:53.950
It lets me return one card 
from the field to my hand.

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:56.710
I add Handstandaccoon to my hand.

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:00.220
You destroyed your Pendulum Scale?

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:04.240
And I activate the monster 
effect of Dag Daggerman!

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:07.160
I send one Performapal from 
my hand to my graveyard,

00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:09.630
to draw one card from my deck!

00:14:12.150 --> 00:14:12.830
Yes...

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:18.070
I set Scale 4 Performapal Trump 
Witch in my Pendulum Zone!

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:23.000
Trump Witch's Pendulum Effect

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:26.110
lets me Fusion Summon without 
a Polymerization card.

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:31.320
I fuse Performapal Dag Daggerman 
and Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:33.850
What? Fusion Summon?

00:14:34.480 --> 00:14:36.410
The peerless user of short blades...

00:14:36.410 --> 00:14:38.800
The dragon with shining, 
different-colored eyes...

00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:42.410
Become one, and awaken a new life!

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:44.760
Fusion Summon!

00:14:45.270 --> 00:14:48.110
In that instant, until the End Phase of this turn,

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:51.700
the attack points of all monsters 
are reduced to 0.

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:57.640
What's happening?

00:14:58.000 --> 00:14:59.610
Appear!

00:14:59.980 --> 00:15:03.380
Heroic dragon whose eyes 
burn with sublime fire,

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:06.180
Brave-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:08.790
Wh-What?

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:11.020
Incredible.

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:13.240
This dragon...

00:15:15.590 --> 00:15:20.010
Yuya still intends to communicate 
with Academia via duels?

00:15:20.970 --> 00:15:22.950
You mock me...

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:26.880
Brave-Eyes's other effect.

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:32.380
For every monster with 0 attack points, 
its attack points increase by 100!

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:35.480
Yes!

00:15:35.480 --> 00:15:37.920
Now, it's 3100 to 0.

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:39.800
And Edo's life is—

00:15:41.350 --> 00:15:46.360
Is Academia's sub-commander 
taking the side of the Lancers?

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:49.610
N-N-No!

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:52.830
It's, well, of course not...

00:15:53.150 --> 00:15:54.290
Battle!

00:15:54.290 --> 00:16:00.390
I attack Destiny HERO — Dystopia with 
Brave-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:03.680
Red-Hot Mega-Flame Burst!

00:16:04.410 --> 00:16:05.800
It's no use!

00:16:05.800 --> 00:16:10.190
Delay Armor's effect prevents 
Dystopia's destruction by battle.

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:13.000
Your pathetic, imitation Fusion 
Summon is nothing.

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:15.290
Brave-Eyes's third effect!

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:15.890
What?

00:16:16.340 --> 00:16:18.020
When Brave-Eyes attacks,

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:21.090
destruction by battle cannot be negated!

00:16:21.090 --> 00:16:23.260
You think that will work?

00:16:23.260 --> 00:16:25.060
I activate my Continuous Trap!

00:16:25.470 --> 00:16:27.330
Urban Demise!

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:28.530
Once per turn,

00:16:28.530 --> 00:16:33.500
I increase the attack points of one D-HERO 
on my side of the field by 100.

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:36.250
Dystopia's effect...

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:40.040
Once per turn, if its attack or 
defense points change,

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:43.180
it can destroy one monster on your field!

00:16:43.180 --> 00:16:45.210
Noble Justice!

00:16:45.210 --> 00:16:48.350
Academia's Fusion Summon 
is the true Fusion Summon.

00:16:48.350 --> 00:16:50.540
Disappear, fake!

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:52.670
No...

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:53.660
Damn.

00:16:54.550 --> 00:16:55.880
Do you understand now?

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:58.710
No matter what you do, your voice 
will never reach him.

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:01.510
A torn-up card...

00:17:01.510 --> 00:17:03.830
Is that Smile World?

00:17:05.380 --> 00:17:08.180
Is that my father's card?

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:11.660
Why do you have it?!

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:12.570
Never mind.

00:17:12.570 --> 00:17:14.710
Your turn isn't over yet!

00:17:14.710 --> 00:17:18.180
Answer me! Why do you have Dad's card?!

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:21.790
Very well...

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:26.580
It began shortly after I came 
to the Xyz Dimension.

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:30.760
Are you the one?

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:35.970
The one spouting nonsense about 
bringing smiles with duels?

00:17:35.970 --> 00:17:37.710
You're half-right.

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:38.500
What?

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:43.850
I am the one who talks about 
bringing smiles with duels.

00:17:43.850 --> 00:17:46.210
But I don't believe it's nonsense.

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:47.450
Shut up!

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:51.880
I shall purge anyone who defies 
Academia's teachings.

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:52.740
Let's duel.

00:17:55.880 --> 00:18:00.250
I had a duel with Yusyo Sakaki,

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:02.890
to prove that Academia was correct.

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:06.940
I attack Yusyo Sakaki 
directly with Dystopia!

00:18:12.420 --> 00:18:14.830
Now, I end my turn.

00:18:14.830 --> 00:18:16.920
Not bad at all...

00:18:16.920 --> 00:18:20.860
But if we're going to duel, let's enjoy it.

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:24.790
I activate my spell card Smile World!

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:31.960
And in the end...

00:18:33.560 --> 00:18:36.060
I lost...

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:39.760
Impossible.

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:42.140
How could I lose?

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:43.350
But...

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:45.970
It was fun, right?

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:48.650
Fun? Even though I lost?

00:18:48.650 --> 00:18:50.600
What are you talking about?

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:53.180
If that's true, then Academia...

00:18:53.550 --> 00:18:57.580
You've learned that using duels 
for war is foolish, haven't you?

00:18:57.580 --> 00:19:01.420
Then, I want you to tell Leo Akaba yourself.

00:19:04.360 --> 00:19:07.450
Are you saying that Acadmia's teachings...

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:09.860
That the Professor's teachings are wrong?

00:19:10.930 --> 00:19:11.830
Yes.

00:19:32.320 --> 00:19:34.690
No! No! No!

00:19:35.160 --> 00:19:36.800
Stop talking nonsense!

00:19:36.800 --> 00:19:38.640
I will not be deceived...

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:40.800
Academia is always right.

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:43.130
The Professor's teachings are absolute!

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:46.440
Oh, boy.

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:48.830
This is a tough one.

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:58.310
Yusyo Sakaki... is gone?

00:19:59.140 --> 00:20:03.050
The area contained no card into 
which he'd been sealed.

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:05.630
If he hadn't been turned into a card,

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:08.380
could he have been sent 
to another dimension?

00:20:08.820 --> 00:20:14.980
No, he probably ran off when 
I wasn't paying attention.

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:20.970
Ever since, I've been traveling, 
searching for Yusyo Sakaki.

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:27.940
I want to beat that man in a duel. 
And prove the Professor correct.

00:20:28.780 --> 00:20:32.110
That was when Yusyo's son appeared.

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:36.100
Surely, I couldn't lose to his son.

00:20:36.690 --> 00:20:39.980
But our duel ended in a draw...

00:20:41.290 --> 00:20:44.990
That is why I must beat you, no matter what!

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:47.960
Now, do you understand?

00:20:48.420 --> 00:20:51.930
Reaching an understanding 
with a duel is impossible.

00:20:53.670 --> 00:20:57.640
I set one card and end my turn.

00:20:58.120 --> 00:21:02.170
In that instant, Brave-Eyes Pendulum 
Dragon's effect ends,

00:21:02.580 --> 00:21:05.030
and Dystopia's attack points return to normal.

00:21:06.140 --> 00:21:08.610
My turn. Draw!

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:11.320
Prepare yourself, Yuya Sakaki...

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:16.790
In order to prove Academia's teachings 
correct, I shall crush you!

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:20.490
I am going to crush Yusyo Sakaki's son!

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:25.560
Yuya Sakaki has a mere 600 life points.

00:21:25.560 --> 00:21:26.740
It's over.

00:21:27.320 --> 00:21:28.410
No way.

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:31.440
He has to make it more fun!

00:21:34.070 --> 00:21:35.500
What are you smiling about?

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:36.910
Well,

00:21:37.740 --> 00:21:41.380
I believe he's been thinking, all this time...

00:21:41.920 --> 00:21:44.080
About that half of Smile World.

00:21:44.080 --> 00:21:49.790
Destiny HERO — Dystopia attacks 
Yuya Sakaki directly!

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:53.660
It is a lie.

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:55.030
He's wrong.

00:21:55.700 --> 00:22:00.580
I shall absolutely never smile...

00:22:00.930 --> 00:22:03.400
Go, Dystopia!

00:22:03.740 --> 00:22:06.500
Dystopia Blow!

00:23:48.880 --> 00:23:52.490
Your heart is swinging, like this pendulum!

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:55.380
My heart is swinging?

00:23:55.380 --> 00:23:57.680
Between your desire to 
believe in the Professor

00:23:58.040 --> 00:24:02.550
and your feelings from when you 
dueled my dad, Yusyo Sakaki.

00:24:02.550 --> 00:24:05.100
You're vacillating between the two.

00:24:05.100 --> 00:24:06.800
Don't spout nonsense!

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:08.600
Duels are not games!

00:24:08.600 --> 00:24:10.150
They are the power to fight!

00:24:10.660 --> 00:24:14.100
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Pendulum Heart.

00:24:14.100 --> 00:24:16.250
The fun is only getting started!
